Those birds are flyers,
so they're naturally lightweight.

52
00:02:43,465 --> 00:02:45,634
Not exactly built for a brawl like this.

53
00:02:45,718 --> 00:02:47,261
You make a solid point.

54
00:02:47,344 --> 00:02:49,305
You must have been
in your fair share of fights.

55
00:02:49,388 --> 00:02:52,182
[splutters] No, not at all.
I just read it somewhere.

56
00:02:52,266 --> 00:02:53,601
