57
00:02:54,435 --> 00:02:59,648
Well, either way, these chumps just got
their asses handed to 'em by an old man.

58
00:03:01,442 --> 00:03:02,985
They'll wake up soon enough.

59
00:03:04,028 --> 00:03:05,154
[Gosha grunts softly]

60
00:03:06,739 --> 00:03:08,240
- Listen, kiddo.
- [Legoshi] Mmm?

61
00:03:08,324 --> 00:03:11,994
Only reason I stopped by
is 'cause I was worried about you.

62
00:03:12,077 --> 00:03:16,498
But it looks to me like
you no longer need any help from Grandpa.

63
00:03:16,582 --> 00:03:17,708
[both chuckle softly]

64
00:03:22,630 --> 00:03:23,631
[music ends]

65
00:03:24,924 --> 00:03:28,302
[Louis] Azuki, I do hope that
you enjoyed the wine this evening.

66
00:03:29,011 --> 00:03:30,262
I did, Louis.

67
00:03:30,346 --> 00:03:34,183
And I would swear I saw a hint of a smile
after you tasted that tagliolini.

68
00:03:34,266 --> 00:03:38,479
Yes. How could I not, with the asparagus
in that buttery cream sauce?

69
00:03:38,562 --> 00:03:40,439
A truly elegant dish.

70
00:03:40,522 --> 00:03:42,733
You really do have
a regular appetite then.

71
00:03:42,816 --> 00:03:43,901
[Louis] Hmm?

72
00:03:43,984 --> 00:03:45,152
Forgive me for asking,

73
00:03:45,236 --> 00:03:49,114
but my father, he mentioned to me
that you had lost your right leg.

74
00:03:49,198 --> 00:03:50,241
Ah, yes.

75
00:03:50,324 --> 00:03:52,326
There was an accident.

76
00:03:52,409 --> 00:03:55,621
Truth be told,
I'm very fortunate to be alive right now.

77
00:03:55,704 --> 00:03:56,747
Oh, is that so?

78
00:03:57,248 --> 00:04:00,417
Mmm. This accident didn't impact you
sexually, did it?

79
00:04:01,669 --> 00:04:02,836
Excuse me?

80
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,214
Well, it's very important that I know.

81
00:04:05,297 --> 00:04:07,967
If we were to marry and learn later
that we couldn't have children,

82
00:04:08,050 --> 00:04:09,468
we'd be in real trouble.

83
00:04:09,551 --> 00:04:10,386
[Louis huffs]

84
00:04:10,970 --> 00:04:11,887
I'll have you know

85
00:04:11,971 --> 00:04:14,473
that The Horns Conglomerate
is not so desperate

86
00:04:14,556 --> 00:04:16,934
that I'd answer that question
in a place like this.

87
00:04:17,017 --> 00:04:20,771
[giggles] For all your worldliness,
you're still so naive.

88
00:04:20,854 --> 00:04:21,939
[Louis grunts softly]

89
00:04:23,190 --> 00:04:25,234
Though maybe
I should've followed your lead

90
00:04:25,317 --> 00:04:29,029
and made my invitation
a little more charming and direct.

91
00:04:30,197 --> 00:04:31,365
I booked us a room.

92
00:04:32,116 --> 00:04:33,367
[Louis hesitates]

93
00:04:33,450 --> 00:04:35,995
I mean, we are going to be married
after all.

94
00:04:36,078 --> 00:04:38,539
We might as well
get to know each other properly.

95
00:04:39,164 --> 00:04:40,124
[gasps]

96
00:04:41,417 --> 00:04:44,086
- [Louis grunting softly]
- [Azuki moaning]

97
00:04:48,465 --> 00:04:51,218
- Azuki, wait.
- Mmm, what's the matter?

98
00:04:51,302 --> 00:04:54,847
- Are you not enjoying this?
- No, it's just...

99
00:04:54,930 --> 00:04:58,100
- Could you get me a glass of water?
- [giggles]

100
00:04:59,310 --> 00:05:02,396
[Louis] <i>I'm acting like a virgin.
What's wrong with me?</i>

101
00:05:04,023 --> 00:05:07,735
<i>The very fact that carnivores
and herbivores coexist in the same society</i>

102
00:05:07,818 --> 00:05:09,445
<i>is an affront to the laws of nature.</i>

103
00:05:09,528 --> 00:05:12,573
- [goat] <i>You have to admit that.</i>
- [sheep] <i>Isn't that a rather extreme view?</i>

104
00:05:12,656 --> 00:05:15,492
[sheep] <i>Now, I don't believe
that society would've developed as it has</i>

105
00:05:15,576 --> 00:05:18,078
<i>if carnivores and herbivores
hadn't chosen to live together.</i>

106
00:05:18,162 --> 00:05:21,081
[goat] <i>And if we lived separately,
we wouldn't see the awful devouring...</i>

107
00:05:21,165 --> 00:05:22,708
[Louis] <i>Is this really okay?</i>

108
00:05:23,917 --> 00:05:26,795
<i>The consummation
of a marriage of convenience?</i>

109
00:05:27,296 --> 00:05:29,214
<i>Is this really meant to be my purpose?</i>

110
00:05:29,298 --> 00:05:30,758
[TV conversation continues]

111
00:05:30,841 --> 00:05:33,886
[Ibuki] <i>Louis, you changed my life
for the better.</i>

112
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,806
[Azuki moaning softly]

113
00:05:42,352 --> 00:05:44,438
[Louis] <i>It's fine. This is fine.</i>

114
00:05:45,939 --> 00:05:48,942
<i>Fragile, slender bodies coming together.</i>

115
00:05:49,026 --> 00:05:51,445
<i>This is normal. Nothing strange about it.</i>

116
00:05:52,362 --> 00:05:54,907
<i>I'm the one who's become strange.</i>

117
00:05:54,990 --> 00:05:58,243
<i>Everything about this situation
feels so out of place.</i>

118
00:05:58,327 --> 00:06:00,329
[TV conversation continues indistinctly]

119
00:06:02,206 --> 00:06:03,999
<i>Her kiss isn't like Juno's.</i>

120
00:06:04,708 --> 00:06:08,295
<i>The sensation of those hard canine teeth
isn't there.</i>

121
00:06:09,004 --> 00:06:10,422
[both grunt]

122
00:06:10,506 --> 00:06:13,342
<i>No, stop comparing them! Concentrate!</i>

123
00:06:13,425 --> 00:06:16,053
<i>Don't get distracted.
Stay on the right path.</i>

124
00:06:16,845 --> 00:06:20,432
<i>Make love to her.
It's as simple as that. Do it!</i>

125
00:06:20,516 --> 00:06:23,519
<i>Make love to Azuki,
a female of your own species!</i>

126
00:06:23,602 --> 00:06:25,687
- Uh... Huh?
- [goat on TV] <i>It's dangerous, abnormal!</i>

127
00:06:25,771 --> 00:06:27,272
[strained groaning]

128
00:06:27,356 --> 00:06:29,358
Louis, are you all right?

129
00:06:29,441 --> 00:06:30,692
[gags]

130
00:06:32,319 --> 00:06:34,404
- [retching]
- [Azuki gasps]

131
00:06:34,488 --> 00:06:35,823
[Louis coughs]

132
00:06:38,659 --> 00:06:42,579
[Louis] <i>There's no question now.
I'm no longer who I used to be.</i>

133
00:06:47,376 --> 00:06:49,211
{\an8}FESTIVAL OF THE METEOR
JULY 27, FRIDAY

134
00:06:49,294 --> 00:06:50,629
{\an8}[Mayor] Hmm.

135
00:06:51,463 --> 00:06:53,632
{\an8}This one isn't half bad either.

136
00:06:54,383 --> 00:06:56,426
MAYOR

137
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:57,386
[sniffs]

138
00:06:58,220 --> 00:07:00,055
[sighs contentedly]

139
